WEBVTT

00:07:58.309 --> 00:08:00.418
including eat, yell,
play chess and so forth.

00:08:00.442 --> 00:08:04.448
Now we're moving up into what we call
the mixing chamber.

00:08:04.472 --> 00:08:07.400
That was the main
technology area in the building.

00:08:07.424 --> 00:08:10.000
You'll have to tell me
if I'm going too fast for you.

00:08:14.201 --> 00:08:15.351
And now up.

00:08:20.566 --> 00:08:23.195
This is actually the place
that we put into the building

00:08:23.219 --> 00:08:25.252
so I could propose
to my wife, right there.

00:08:25.276 --> 00:08:27.395
(Laughter)

00:08:28.000 --> 00:08:29.159
She said yes.

00:08:29.183 --> 00:08:31.183
(Laughter)